  "title": "wsutil: Use -Wno-maybe-uninitialized for GCC builds of dtoa.c.",
  "description": "Release builds with GCC 12.2 (at least) building dtoa.c produces spurious\nwarnings about ulpmask being maybe used while uninitialized.  There's no actual\ndefect here, so let's just silence that warning for this one file when using\nGCC.  Since this is a third-party module and presumably will be quite stable,\nthere doesn't seem to be much value in restricting this change by build type or\nGCC version.",
